      "evidence": "Step 3 says, “If any result is `inconclusive` or contains unresolved boxes, return `inconclusive`.” The `alg-smooth-function-root-isolation` dependency says its status is `complete` exactly when the unresolved list is empty and otherwise `inconclusive`. Since B_root may be 0, an active guard can leave the initial box unresolved and trigger Step 3’s `inconclusive` return; the final sentence instead says, “Any exhausted step, root-box, or event budget returns `budget-exhausted`.” Steps 4, 5, 7, and 8 also return `inconclusive` when root-box work cannot continue at the budget limit. The procedure gives conflicting statuses for an allowed root-budget exhaustion.",
